# Integrations

This layer records external system access intent, permission scope, and token storage policy.

Rules:

- Do not commit tokens, app secrets, cookies, refresh tokens, or private keys.
- GitHub permissions are recorded in `integrations/github.yml`.
- Feishu/Lark permissions are recorded in `integrations/feishu.yml`.
- Hermes incremental sync is recorded in `integrations/hermes.yml`.
- Real secrets belong in local environment variables, a password manager, or platform secret storage.
